msgctxt "comic47#p5.1"
msgid "WHEEE!!!"
msgstr "УИИИ!!!"

#. comic48 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#title.1"
msgid "\"THAT'S JUST THE WAY IT IS\""
msgstr "«ТАК УЖ ВСЁ УСТРОЕНО»"

#. comic48 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: ridecar.gif, floor6walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:73
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p1.1"
msgid "\"Thank you for taking the Moderators Tour Ride; please remain seated until the vehicle comes to a complete stop and have a nice day.\""
msgstr "«Спасибо, что посетили экскурсию Модераторов. Пожалуйста, оставайтесь на местах до полной остановки вагончика. Хорошего дня!»"

#. comic48 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ridecar.gif, floor6walk.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:83
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p1.2"
msgid "Well folks, that's our story."
msgstr "Что ж, народ, вот наша история."

#. comic48 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:136
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p2.1"
msgid "So, what happens to us next?"
msgstr "Ну и что с нами будет дальше?"

#. comic48 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:140
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p2.2"
msgid "Oh, you're free to go now."
msgstr "О, теперь вы свободны."

#. comic48 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:188
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p3.1"
msgid "...And do what?"
msgstr "…И что делать?"

#. comic48 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:192
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p3.2"
msgid "The usual. Become a productive member of society, forge your own destiny, chase your dreams, etc."
msgstr "Как все. Стать полезным членом общества, ковать судьбу, идти за мечтой и т. д."

#. comic48 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:240
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p4.1"
msgid "But how do I do that?"
msgstr "Но как это делается?"

#. comic48 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, qbtalk2.gif, bogeystand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:244
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p4.2"
msgid "Generally, you start by finding a job."
msgstr "Обычно начинают с поиска работы."

#. comic48 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand2.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:292
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p5.1"
msgid "I have this sudden feeling of impending doom..."
msgstr "У меня вдруг предчувствие неминуемой гибели…"

#. comic48 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddstand2.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:294
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p5.2"
msgid "It'll wear off with your first paycheck."
msgstr "Пройдёт с первой зарплатой."

#. comic48 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand2.gif, qbstand2.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic48.htm:296
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic48#p5.3"
msgid "This conformist is raring to go!"
msgstr "Этот конформист рвётся в бой!"

#. comic49 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#title.1"
msgid "\"THE FIRST STEP\""
msgstr "«ПЕРВЫЙ ШАГ»"

#. comic49 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p1.1"
msgid "So... um..."
msgstr "Ну… эм…"

#. comic49 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p1.2"
msgid "Just next door you can fill out all your paperwork to register as a new citizen."
msgstr "Рядом можно оформить все бумаги и зарегистрироваться как новый гражданин."

#. comic49 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:135
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p2.1"
msgid "Paperwork. Right..."
msgstr "Бумаги. Ясно…"

#. comic49 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:139
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p2.2"
msgid "They'll direct you to the employment office, where you can see what jobs are open."
msgstr "Там вас направят в бюро по трудоустройству, где можно узнать о вакансиях."

#. comic49 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddleft.gif, bogeystand2.gif, qbtalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:187
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p3.1"
msgid "Thanks. I guess..."
msgstr "Спасибо. Наверное…"

#. comic49 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddleft.gif, bogeystand2.gif, qbtalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:191
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p3.2"
msgid "And if you've got any questions or problems, we at the Moderators will always be here to help you!"
msgstr "А если у вас будут вопросы или проблемы, мы, Модераторы, всегда готовы помочь!"

#. comic49 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeytalk.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:239
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p4.1"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Правда?"

#. comic49 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeytalk.gif, qbstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic49.htm:243
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic49#p4.2"
msgid "No, not really."
msgstr "Нет, не правда."
